@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@username = user-name

### Health/status da API e do banco de dados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/status

### Lista as migrations pendentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/migrations

### Executa as migrations pendentes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/migrations

### Cria um usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "change-me"
}

### Busca um usuário pelo username
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{username}}

### Atualiza um usuário pelo username
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{username}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "change-me"
}

### Cria uma sessão (login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "change-me"
}
